  "description": "\"Only the true hero can take down the Demon Lord.\" Well, Presidio Cage has already accomplished that... numerous times. He can catch the Demon Lord with his bare hands, but every time he does, he's sent to the beginning of the game again. Although he knows all the tips and tricks, he doesn't know how to escape this endless loop. In order to switch things up, Cage summons a \"new\" hero to defeat the enemy in his stead. Now, he's ready to create the ultimate newbie and finally get back home! \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
